---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (Shared across sale types)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_transfer: authorized
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(token, recipient, amount), emit EmergencyWithdrawal

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: only Legion operators can execute emergency withdrawals
        INV-002: can withdraw any ERC20 token held by the contract
        INV-003: no state validation - emergency override mechanism
    end note
